## Clap：命令行参数解析

`clap` 是 Rust 最流行的命令行参数解析库，支持声明式的派生宏语法。

```rust
use clap::{Parser, Subcommand};

#[derive(Parser)]
#[command(name = "mytool")]
#[command(about = "一个示例 CLI 工具", version)]
struct Cli {
    #[arg(short, long, default_value = "info")]
    log_level: String,

    #[command(subcommand)]
    command: Commands,
}

#[derive(Subcommand)]
enum Commands {
    Init {
        #[arg(short, long)]
        name: String,
    },
    Build {
        #[arg(short, long)]
        release: bool,
    },
    Clean,
}

fn main() {
    let cli = Cli::parse();

    println!("日志级别: {}", cli.log_level);

    match cli.command {
        Commands::Init { name } => {
            println!("初始化项目: {}", name);
        }
        Commands::Build { release } => {
            println!("构建项目 (release={})", release);
        }
        Commands::Clean => {
            println!("清理构建产物");
        }
    }
}
```

```bash
$ mytool --log-level debug init --name my-project
日志级别: debug
初始化项目: my-project

$ mytool build --release
构建项目 (release=true)
```

